    │
 12 │     .Some(.Word(text)) => move text
    │                                ──┬─
    │                                  ╰─── a `match` binding, which refers to part of the matched value
    │
    │ Help: it lies behind a reference, which neither `move` nor `match move` takes from; copy it with `clone()`
