 19 │         tokens.push(.Space)
    │         ───┬──
    │            ╰──── `tokens` passed as `&var` here
 20 │         return text.len()
    │                ──┬─
    │                  ╰─── used here
    │
    │ Help: use `text` before `tokens` changes, or keep a copy of the value it points to
